<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Gpu-Performance on 111qqz's blog</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/tags/gpu-performance/</link><description>Recent content in Gpu-Performance on 111qqz's blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>hust.111qqz@gmail.com (111qqz)</managingEditor><webMaster>hust.111qqz@gmail.com (111qqz)</webMaster><copyright>© 2011-2026 111qqz</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://111qqz.com/en/tags/gpu-performance/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>FlashAttention 的核心思想：为什么 Attention Matrix 根本不需要存下来？</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-10-21-flash-attention-tiling-online-softmax/</link><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>hust.111qqz@gmail.com (111qqz)</author><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-10-21-flash-attention-tiling-online-softmax/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;之前的几篇把 Self-Attention 的公式拆得比较清楚了，从 &lt;a href="https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-09-18-single-head-attention-qkv/" &gt;QKV 的计算含义&lt;/a&gt;到 &lt;a href="https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-09-19-multi-head-attention/" &gt;Multi-Head 的分工&lt;/a&gt;。另一条线是 GPU 性能——&lt;a href="https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-09-03-arithmetic-intensity-compute-bound/" &gt;Arithmetic Intensity、memory bound、HBM 带宽&lt;/a&gt;这些概念也已经聊过。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从 CS336 到 ML Infra：理解 Arithmetic Intensity、Accelerator Intensity，以及 Compute Bound / Memory Bound</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-09-03-arithmetic-intensity-compute-bound/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>hust.111qqz@gmail.com (111qqz)</author><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-09-03-arithmetic-intensity-compute-bound/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;起因
 &lt;div id="起因" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e8%b5%b7%e5%9b%a0" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这是 CS336 系列的又一篇。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-08-15-flops-to-latency/" &gt;之前那篇&lt;/a&gt;讨论了 FLOPs 到 Latency 之间的鸿沟：FLOPs 相同的两个 GEMM，latency 可能差几倍甚至十几倍。那篇文章的核心结论是 &lt;strong&gt;FLOPs 是 workload metric，不是 performance metric&lt;/strong&gt;，并且引入了 Arithmetic Intensity 和 Roofline Model 作为分析工具。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>从 FLOPs 到 Latency：GPU 推理性能到底由什么决定？</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-08-15-flops-to-latency/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 21:08:54 +0800</pubDate><author>hust.111qqz@gmail.com (111qqz)</author><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0/2026-08-15-flops-to-latency/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;起因
 &lt;div id="起因" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e8%b5%b7%e5%9b%a0" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;最近在做 CS336（Language Modeling from Scratch）的 resource accounting 作业，里面要求逐个列出 Transformer forward pass 中所有的 matmul，然后按 \(2MKN\) 计算 FLOPs。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>